	(text "WS2812 needs V_IH >= 3.5 V at 5 V: 74AHCT1G125 shifts 3.3 V to 5 V.\n100k pull-down: no random colours during reset. 330R damps the data line.\nPolyfuse 0.75 A: 8 x WS2812 full white = 0.48 A. Port: 1 DIN, 2 GND, 3 5V."
